        "1. Sign in to Dreamina in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → Dreamina → Dreamina Settings**.\n2. In **Frame**, upload `example_workflows/assets/dreamina/host-in-kitchen.webp` from this pack's folder, or any picture.\n3. In **Scene**, say what happens.\n4. Press **Run**. The video is saved under `video/dreamina`."
