      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedance 2.0 Mini starts on **Frame** and makes a four-second `720p` video in a `9:16` frame. With one picture connected, the node uses `first_last_frame`, the mode that starts the video on that picture.\n\nA cancel does not stop a video Dreamina has accepted. It keeps running and is billed. Collect it with **Generation: Download** in **video-04-recover-a-video**."
